# Normalise line endings in the repo so the clinical parity check compares
# against the same bytes on every machine. Without this, a Windows checkout
# rewrites src/App.jsx as CRLF while the upstream blob stays LF, and the
# check reports all 14 clinical sections as drifted at once — noise that
# would train someone to ignore the one check that must be believed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The workbook template is a zip; any "text" handling corrupts it.
*.xlsx binary
